hub.com/users/BaconEggsRL/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-21T01:33:54Z","updated_at":"2026-02-21T01:41:23Z","body":"Any blockers to merging this?\r\nI was looking for a way to auto-expand @export_group when a resource is created; not sure if this would solve that.\r\n\r\nSomething like:\r\n\r\n```\r\n@tool\r\nclass_name MyCustomResource\r\nextends Resource\r\n\r\n@export_group(\"Points\")\r\n@export var points: Array[Point] = []\r\n\r\nfunc _ready():\r\n    expand_group(\"Points\")\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3937876473/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4521647574","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99725#issuecomment-4521647574","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99725","id":4521647574,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDYLd1g","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-22T18:20:49Z","updated_at":"2026-06-23T23:18:07Z","body":"Rebased and tested again, it works as expected.\r\n\r\n> You can add a new signal that informs that the resource should be expanded, e.g. `request_expand`.\r\n\r\nDone in the second commit. Note that `resource_expand_requested` may be emitted without also emitting `resource_selected`. (I tried to emit both at the same time, but this made the resource expansion have no visible effect.)\r\n\r\n**Edit (June 2026):** Commits squashed.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4521647574/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4533124434","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99725#issuecomment-4533124434","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99725","id":4533124434,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDjH9Ug","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.githu